                <h1>Habitat V0.4.2</h1>
                <h4>Changelog</h4>
                <li>Fixed: Notch Nook not dismissing sometimes when interacting with it.</li>
                <li>Fixed: Wave recognizing old app drivers / plugins from uninstalled apps.</li>
                <li>Fixed: Wave no longer requires system audio permissions.</li>
                <li>Fixed: Snap cursor not following were selection area was dragged to.</li>
                </ul>
                <p><br>More to come.<br><br>
                — Thank you for all the support & feedback!</p>
